    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96300" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταυρ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταυρός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fence with pales</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὰ βάθη ξύλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					24.1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.100
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>crucify</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.86.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				20.19
			</span></i>, Critodem. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(4).200
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὴν σάρκα</span>
			<i>crucify</i> it, <i>destroy</i> its power, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
				5.24
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.14
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἧλος ἐσταυρωμένος</span> nail
				<i>from a cross</i>, as amulet, <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.Jun.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				1.15
			</span></i>.</div>
